{
  "title": "The alphabet: A to M",
  "kind": "alphabet",
  "cefr": "A0",
  "estMinutes": 7,
  "intro": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "1. The letters"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "English has 26 letters. Here are the first 13."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        [
          "A a",
          "B b",
          "C c",
          "D d"
        ],
        [
          "E e",
          "F f",
          "G g",
          "H h"
        ],
        [
          "I i",
          "J j",
          "K k",
          "L l"
        ],
        [
          "M m"
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Every letter has two forms: a capital (big) letter and a small letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "en": "A → a, B → b, G → g"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "2. Vowels and consonants"
    },
    {
      "type": "rule",
      "title": "Vowels and consonants",
      "points": [
        "A, E and I are vowels (A to M).",
        "The other letters (B, C, D, F, G, H, J, K, L, M) are consonants.",
        "Every English word has a vowel sound."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "3. Grammar focus: capital letters"
    },
    {
      "type": "rule",
      "title": "We use a capital letter for:",
      "points": [
        "the first word of a sentence: My name is Ali.",
        "names of people: Bobur, Madina",
        "the word I: I am a student."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "example",
      "en": "Good morning, Anna!",
      "note": "G and A are capital letters"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Be careful!"
    },
    {
      "type": "mistake",
      "wrong": "i am bekzod.",
      "right": "I am Bekzod.",
      "why": "I and names always start with a capital letter."
    },
    {
      "type": "mistake",
      "wrong": "my name is Lola",
      "right": "My name is Lola.",
      "why": "A sentence starts with a capital letter and ends with a full stop."
    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "text": "Say the letters in order every day: A, B, C, D …"
    }
  ],
  "exercises": [
